@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false

title UC-01 发布救助线索

actor "USER / RESCUER" as User
participant "移动端\nUniApp" as App
participant "RescueClueController" as C
participant "IdempotencyService" as I
participant "RescueClueService" as S
participant "TemporaryFileMapper" as TFM
participant "RescueClueMapper" as CM
participant "RescueClueImageMapper" as CIM
participant "OperationLogMapper" as OLM
participant "FileService" as FS
database "MySQL" as DB

note over App,C
JWT 认证、账号状态检查和 RBAC 权限校验
由公共安全链完成，本图不重复展开。
end note

User -> App : 填写线索并点击提交
App -> C : POST /api/rescue-clues/idempotency-keys
C -> I : issue(userId)
I --> C : idempotencyKey + expiresAt
C --> App : 201 Created

App -> C : POST /api/rescue-clues\nIdempotency-Key + DTO + imageTokens
C -> S : createClue(userId, key, dto)

S -> I : 规范化 DTO + 当前用户 + imageTokens原顺序\n计算 SHA-256\natomic compute
alt key 无效 / 已过期
  I --> S : INVALID
  S --> C : 40005 INVALID_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY
  C --> App : 400
else key = PROCESSING
  I --> S : PROCESSING
  S --> C : 40905 IDEMPOTENCY_REQUEST_IN_PROGRESS
  C --> App : 409
else key = SUCCEEDED 且指纹一致
  I --> S : cached response
  S --> C : clueId + status + createdAt
  C --> App : 200 OK
else key = SUCCEEDED 但指纹不同
  I --> S : REUSED
  S --> C : 40906 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
  C --> App : 409
else UNUSED → PROCESSING 成功
  S -> DB : BEGIN

  S -> TFM : SELECT tokens\nORDER BY id ASC FOR UPDATE
  TFM -> DB : SELECT ... FOR UPDATE
  DB --> TFM : rows
  TFM --> S : rows

  S -> S : 校验 token 数量1~9且不重复\nowner/status/expiry/type/size

  S -> CM : INSERT RescueClue\nstatus=PENDING_REVIEW
  CM -> DB : INSERT
  DB --> CM : clueId
  CM --> S : clueId

  loop 按客户端 imageTokens 原顺序
    S -> FS : generateFormalPath(RESCUE_CLUE)
    FS --> S : formalPath
    S -> CIM : INSERT RescueClueImage\nsortOrder=1..N
    CIM -> DB : INSERT

    S -> TFM : UPDATE TemporaryFile\nBOUND + businessType=RESCUE_CLUE\nbusinessId=clueId + formalPath
    TFM -> DB : conditional UPDATE
    DB --> TFM : affectedRows=1
  end

  S -> OLM : INSERT OperationLog\nRESCUE_CLUE + CREATE\nNULL→PENDING_REVIEW
  OLM -> DB : INSERT

  loop 每张图片
    S -> FS : copy temp → formal
    FS --> S : ok
  end

  break 任一数据库写入、OperationLog写入、临时文件校验或 formal copy 失败
    S -> DB : ROLLBACK
    S -> FS : 删除本事务已创建正式副本
    S -> I : PROCESSING → UNUSED
    S --> C : 统一业务异常
    C --> App : 4xx / 5xx
  end

  S -> DB : COMMIT
  DB --> S : committed

  S -> I : afterCommit\nPROCESSING → SUCCEEDED\n缓存 clueId + status + createdAt
  S -> FS : 删除原临时文件
  FS --> S : done / deferred
  S -> TFM : 安全删除 BOUND technical row
  TFM -> DB : DELETE verified rows
  DB --> TFM : done / deferred

  S --> C : clueId + status=PENDING_REVIEW + createdAt
  C --> App : 201 Created
end

@enduml

